          tr { page-break-inside: avoid; }\n        }\n\n        @media (prefers-color-scheme: light) {\n            :root {\n                --bg: #f5f5f5;\n                --surface: #fff;\n                --surface-alt: #f9f9f9;\n                --primary: #e0e0e0;\n                --accent: #d32f2f;\n                --accent-soft: #e57373;\n                --text: #333;\n                --muted: #666;\n            }\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <nav>\n            <a href=\"#overview\" class=\"tab-link\" data-tab=\"overview\">Overview</a>\n            <a href=\"#chapters\" class=\"tab-link\" data-tab=\"chapters\">Chapters</a>\n            <a href=\"#characters\" class=\"tab-link\" data-tab=\"characters\">Characters</a>\n            <a href=\"#pronunciations\" class=\"tab-link\" data-tab=\"pronunciations\">Pronunciations</a>\n            \n        </nav>\n\n        <div id=\"overview\" class=\"tab-content active\">\n            <header>\n                <h1>The Cask of Amontillado - Poe</h1>\n                <p class=\"meta\">\n                    by Edgar Allan Poe &middot; \n                    Narrator's Guide &middot; Generated 2026-01-18 17:11\n                </p>\n                \n                <p class=\"meta\" style=\"margin-top: 0.5rem; font-size: 0.9rem;\">\n                    Analyzed with qwen3:30b-instruct\n                     in \n                    9m 38s\n                </p>\n                \n\n                \n                <p class=\"meta\" style=\"margin-top: 0.5rem; font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--muted);\">\n                    <strong>Started:</strong> Jan 18, 2026 at 5:02 PM &middot;\n                    <strong>Ended:</strong> Jan 18, 2026 at 5:11 PM\n                </p>\n                \n            </header>\n\n            <div class=\"stats\">\n                <div class=\"stat-card\">\n                    <div class=\"value\">2,358</div>\n                    <div class=\"label\">Words</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"stat-card\">\n                    <div class=\"value\">0h 15m</div>\n                    <div class=\"label\">Est. Duration</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"stat-card\">\n                    <div class=\"value\">1</div>\n                    <div class=\"label\">Chapters</div>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class=\"stat-card\">\n                    <div class=\"value\">2</div>\n                    <div class=\"label\">Main Characters</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"stat-card\">\n                    <div class=\"value\">56</div>\n                    <div class=\"label\">Pronunciation Notes</div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            \n            <section>\n                <h2>📚 Book Structure</h2>\n                \n                <p style=\"margin-top: 1rem; line-height: 1.8;\">This book contains 1 chapters. Chapters are numbered sequentially.</p>\n                \n                \n            </section>\n\n            \n            <section>\n                <h2>📖 Plot Summary</h2>\n                <div style=\"margin-top: 1rem; line-height: 1.8; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Amontillado, the story's first-person narrator, opens with a chilling declaration of his intent to enact perfect revenge upon Fortunato, a man who has inflicted an unspecified but deeply personal insult. Set during the chaotic and frenzied carnival season at dusk, Amontillado manipulates Fortunato—drunk, costumed in a jingling motley, and prideful in his connoisseurship—into following him into the damp, bone-strewn catacombs beneath his palazzo. Pretending to seek Fortunato’s expertise in tasting a rare pipe of Amontillado, Amontillado leads him deeper into the family crypts, feigning concern for Fortunato’s worsening cough and offering wine to soothe him, all while subtly reinforcing his victim’s trust and isolation.\n\nAs they descend, the atmosphere grows increasingly oppressive, the air thick with decay and the weight of history. Amontillado’s calm demeanor masks a cold, calculated cruelty, and his false camaraderie serves only to heighten Fortunato’s vulnerability. The turning point arrives when they reach a secluded niche lined with human remains—hidden from view and deep within the catacombs. There, Amontillado suddenly reveals his true intent, chaining Fortunato to the wall with iron manacles. As Fortunato’s initial laughter gives way to desperate pleas, Amontillado begins constructing a brick wall to entomb him alive, layer by layer, methodically sealing his fate while the victim’s cries fade into silence.\n\nThe climax is not marked by violence, but by the quiet, deliberate act of completion: Amontillado finishes the wall, restores the pile of bones over it, and ensures no trace remains. The final moments are steeped in eerie triumph, as Amontillado reflects on the fifty years that have passed with no one discovering the secret. The resolution underscores the permanence of his revenge and the psychological weight of his act—Fortunato’s fate sealed not by rage, but by meticulous planning and the ultimate silence of the tomb. Amontillado’s narration, delivered with chilling calm, reveals a man who has achieved his goal with absolute impunity, forever bound to the memory of his crime.</div>\n                \n                <p style=\"margin-top: 1rem; color: var(--muted);\">\n                    <strong>Themes:</strong> revenge, deception, isolation\n                </p>\n                \n            </section>\n            \n\n            \n            <section>\n                <h2>🤖 Analysis Models</h2>\n                <table style=\"width: 100%; margin-top: 1rem; border-collapse: collapse;\">\n                    <thead>\n                        <tr style=\"border-bottom: 2px solid var(--primary);\">\n                            <th style=\"text-align: left; p