the vaults, Montresor feigns concern for Fortunato’s cough, offering wine to ease his discomfort, while subtly guiding him deeper into the family crypts. Once in a secluded niche lined with human remains, Montresor chains Fortunato to the wall and begins sealing him alive behind a brick wall, methodically building it tier by tier as Fortunato’s initial laughter turns to desperate pleas and finally silence. The chapter ends with Montresor completing the wall, restoring the pile of bones over it, and declaring that no one has disturbed the site in fifty years.</div>\n   792→   792→                \n   793→   793→                \n   794→   794→                <div class=\"chapter-characters\" style=\"margin-top: 0.75rem;\">\n   795→   795→                    <strong style=\"margin-right: 0.5rem; color: var(--muted);\">Characters:</strong>\n   796→   796→                    \n   797→   797→                    <span class=\"tag\">Montresor</span>\n   798→   798→                    \n   799→   799→                    <span class=\"tag\">Fortunato</span>\n   800→   800→                    \n   801→   801→                    \n   802→   802→                </div>\n   803→   803→                \n   804→   804→            </div>\n   805→   805→            \n   806→   806→        </section>\n   807→   807→        </div>\n   808→   808→\n   809→   809→        <div id=\"characters\" class=\"tab-content\">\n   810→   810→        <section>\n   811→   811→            <h2>👥 Character Guide</h2>\n   812→   812→\n   813→   813→            <!-- Confidence Filter -->\n   814→   814→            <div style=\"margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\">\n   815→   815→                <label style=\"color: var(--muted); margin-right: 0.5rem;\">\n   816→   816→                    <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"show-low-confidence-only\" onchange=\"filterByConfidence(this.checked)\">\n   817→   817→                    Show only low-confidence items\n   818→   818→                </label>\n   819→   819→       