er-card\">\n   786→                <h4>\n   787→                    <span>Chapter 1</span>\n   788→                    <span class=\"meta\">2,354 words &middot; 15m</span>\n   789→                </h4>\n   790→                \n   791→                <div class=\"chapter-summary\">The chapter opens with the narrator, Montresor, declaring his intent to exact perfect revenge on Fortunato for an unspecified insult, vowing to punish him with impunity. During the chaotic carnival season at dusk, Montresor lures the drunken, costumed Fortunato—wearing a jingling motley outfit—into the damp, bone-strewn catacombs beneath his palazzo under the pretense of tasting a rare pipe of Amontillado. As they descend through the vaults, Montresor feigns concern for Fortunato’s cough, offering wine to ease his discomfort, while subtly guiding him deeper into the family crypts. Once in a secluded niche lined with human remains, Montresor chains Fortunato to the wall and begins sealing him alive behind a brick wall, methodically building it tier by tier as Fortunato’s initial laughter turns to desperate pleas and finally silence. The chapter ends with Montresor completing the wall, restoring the pile of bones over it, and declaring that no one has disturbed the site in fifty years.</div>\n   792→                \n   793→                \n   794→                <div class=\"chapter-characters\" style=\"margin-top: 0.75rem;\">\n   795→                    <strong style=\"margin-right: 0.5rem; color: var(--muted);\">Characters:</strong>\n   796→                    \n   797→                    <span class=\"tag\">Montresor</span>\n   798→                    \n   799→                    <span class=\"tag\">Fortunato</span>\n   800→                    \n   801→                    \n   802→                </div>\n   803→                \n   804→            </div>\n   805→            \n   806→        </section>\n   807→        </div>\n   808→\n   809→        <div id=\"characters\" class=\"tab-content\">\n   810→        <section>\n   811→            <h2>👥 Character Guide</h2>\n   812→\n   813→            <!-- Confidence Filter -->\n   814→            <div style=\"margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\">\n   815→                <label style=\"color: var(--muted); margin-right: 0.5rem;\">\n   816→                    <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"show-low-confidence-only\" onchange=\"filterByConfidence(this.checked)\">\n   817→                    Show only low-confidence items\n   818→                </label>\n   819→            </div>\n   820→\n   821→            \n   822→            <div class=\"character-group\">\n   823→                <h3>Main Characters <span class=\"count\">2</span></h3>\n   824→\n   825→                \n   826→                <div class=\"character-profile character-item\" data-confidence=\"low\">\n   827→                    <h4>\n   828→                        Amontillado\n   829→                        \n   830→                        \n   831→                        <span class=\"confidence-badge low\" title=\"Confidence: low\">\n   832→                            ⚠\n   833→                            \n   834→                        </span>\n   835→                    </h4>\n   836→\n   837→                    \n   838→\n   839→                    \n   840→                    \n   841→\n   842→                    \n   843→\n   844→                    \n   845→\n   846→                    \n   847→                    \n   848→\n   849→                    \n   850→                    \n   851→                    <div class=\"profile-body\">The narrator is a calculated and vengeful individual who manipulates another man, Fortunato, under the pretense of a shared interest in wine, ultimately leading him to his death. Throughout the narrative, the narrator maintains a calm, deceptive demeanor while orchestrating a premeditated murder, revealing his deep-seated malice and lack of remorse through his actions and internal monologue.</div>\n   852→                    \n   853→\n   854→                    \n   855→                    \n   856→\n   857→                    \n   858→                    <details style=\"margin-top: 0.5rem;\">\n   859→                        <summary style=\"cursor: pointer; color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.85rem;\">📊 Metadata</summary>\n   860→                        <div class=\"profile-meta\" style=\"margin-top: 0.5rem; font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--muted);\">\n   861→                            <span>16 mentions</span> •\n   862→                            <span>First appears: Ch. 1</span> •\n   863→                            <span class=\"tag low\">low confidence</span>\n   864→                        </div>\n   865→                    </details>\n   866→                </div>\n   867→                \n   868→                <div class=\"character-profile character-item\" data-confidence=\"low\">\n   869→                    <h4>\n   870→                        Fortunato\n   871→                        \n   872→                        \n   873→                        <span class=\"confidence-badge low\" title=\"Confidence: low\">\n   874→                            ⚠\n   875→                            \n   876→                        </span>\n   877→                    </h4>\n   878→\n   879→                    \n   880→\n   881→                    \n   882→                    \n   883→\n   884→                    \n   885→\n   886→                    \n   887→\n   888→                    \n   889→                    \n   890→\n   891→                    \n   892→                    \n   893→                    <div class=\"profile-body\">Fortunato is a man whose pride in his expertise in wine leads to his downfall. He is portrayed as intoxicated, trusting, and ultimately helpless as he is lured into a trap by Montresor under the guise of a wine tasting, where he is murdered in a hidden catacomb. His initial confidence and apparent joviality mask his vulnerability, which Montresor exploits with calculated cruelty.</div>\n   894→                    \n   895→\n   896→                    \n   897→                    \n   898→\n   899→                    \n   900→                    <details style=\"margin-top: 0.5rem;\">\n   901→                        <summary style=\"cursor: pointer; color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.85rem;\">📊 Metadata</summary>\n   902→                        <div class=\"profile-meta\" style=\"margin-top: 0.5rem; font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--muted);\">\n   903→                            <span>14 mentions</span> •\n   904→                            <span>First appears: Ch. 1</span> •\n   905→                            <span class=\"tag low\">low confidence</span>\n   906→                        </div>\n   907→                    </details>\n   908→                </div>\n   909→                \n   910→            </div>\n   911→            \n   912→\n   913→            \n   914→            <div class=\"character-group\">\n   915→                <h3>Supporting Characters <span class=\"count\">1</span></h3>\n   916→                <table>\n   917→                    <thead>\n   918→                        <tr>\n   919→                            <th>Name</th>\n   920→                            <th>Mentions</th>\n   921→                            <th>First Appears</th>\n   922→                            <th>Aliases</th>\n   923→                        </tr>\n   924→                    </thead>\n   925→                    <tbody>\n   926→                        \n   927→                        <tr>\n   928→                            <td>\n   929→                                <strong>Montresor</strong>\n   930→                                \n   931→                                \n   932→                            </td>\n   933→                            <td>1</td>\n   934→                            <td>Ch. 1</td>\n   935→                            <td class=\"aliases\">—</td>\n   936→                     