mary\" visible in the main tabs (it's in overview section)\n\n---\n\n## 3. Calculate Overall Score\n\n```\nOverall = (\n    Structure × 0.20 +     10 × 0.20 = 2.00\n    Characters × 0.25 +     2 × 0.25 = 0.50\n    Profiles × 0.15 +       3 × 0.15 = 0.45\n    Summaries × 0.20 +      9 × 0.20 = 1.80\n    Pronunciation × 0.10 +  8 × 0.10 = 0.80\n    Presentation × 0.10     9 × 0.10 = 0.90\n)\n\nOverall = 2.00 + 0.50 + 0.45 + 1.80 + 0.80 + 0.90 = 6.45/10\n```\n\n**Overall Score: 6.45/10** (threshold: 8.0) — **FAIL**\n\n---\n\n## 4. Determine Next Action: FAIL\n\nThe score is 6.45 < 8.0, so issues need to be fixed.\n\nNow I'll update the EVALUATION_STATE.md and manifest.json files."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":21615,"cache_read_input_tokens":60655,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":21615,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"99a37a6a-4129-42c2-8ed5-450f251a92c2","uuid":"9342e0c9-b0fe-4e89-9d3e-7c4a88b6c038"}
